      "content": "<!-- \n  Plain UI - Accessible Radios & Selection Cards (Origin UI Inspired)\n  Zero-JS HTML5 + Tailwind CSS v4 Custom Radio Dots, Pricing Cards, Payment Selectors & Segmented Controls\n-->\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 p-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto font-sans text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">\n\n  <!-- Section Header -->\n  <div class=\"space-y-1 border-b border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 pb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400\">Form Controls</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500\">Radio & Groups</span>\n    </div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight\">Accessible Custom Radios & Cards</h2>\n    <p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">\n      Custom radio controls built with HTML5 <code>&lt;input type=\"radio\"&gt;</code>, pricing tier cards, payment method tiles, and segmented switcher bars.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Variant 1: Default Modern Custom Radio -->\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400\">01. Default Custom Radio</span>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2.5\">\n      <label class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 cursor-pointer select-none\">\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"radio-basic\" class=\"peer sr-only\" checked />\n        <span class=\"flex size-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-zinc-300 bg-white transition-all peer-checked:border-zinc-900 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-zinc-950/20 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:peer-checked:border-zinc-100\">\n          <span class=\"size-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 dark:bg-zinc-100 scale-0 peer-checked:scale-100 transition-transform\"></span>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200\">Standard shipping (3-5 business days)</span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 cursor-pointer select-none\">\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"radio-basic\" class=\"peer sr-only\" />\n        <span class=\"flex size-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-zinc-300 bg-white transition-all peer-checked:border-zinc-900 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-zinc-950/20 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:peer-checked:border-zinc-100\">\n          <span class=\"size-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 dark:bg-zinc-100 scale-0 peer-checked:scale-100 transition-transform\"></span>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200\">Express delivery (1-2 business days)</span>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Variant 2: Radio Group with Helper Description -->\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 max-w-md\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400\">02. Radio Group with Descriptions</span>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n      <label class=\"flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer select-none rounded-lg border border-transparent p-2.5 hover:bg-zinc-50 dark:hover:bg-zinc-900/50 transition-colors\">\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"radio-desc\" class=\"peer sr-only\" checked />\n        <span class=\"mt-0.5 flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-zinc-300 bg-white transition-all peer-checked:border-zinc-900 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:peer-checked:border-zinc-100\">\n          <span class=\"size-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 dark:bg-zinc-100 scale-0 peer-checked:scale-100 transition-transform\"></span>\n        </span>\n        <div class=\"space-y-0.5\">\n          <span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">Public repository</span>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">Anyone on the internet can view and clone this repository. You choose who can commit.</p>\n        </div>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer select-none rounded-lg border border-transparent p-2.5 hover:bg-zinc-50 dark:hover:bg-zinc-900/50 transition-colors\">\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"radio-desc\" class=\"peer sr-only\" />\n        <span class=\"mt-0.5 flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-zinc-300 bg-white transition-all peer-checked:border-zinc-900 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:peer-checked:border-zinc-100\">\n          <span class=\"size-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 dark:bg-zinc-100 scale-0 peer-checked:scale-100 transition-transform\"></span>\n        </span>\n        <div class=\"space-y-0.5\">\n          <span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">Private repository</span>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">You choose who can see and commit to this repository.</p>\n        </div>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Variant 3: Radio Cards - Plan Selection -->\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400\">03. Radio Pricing Cards (3-Column Grid)</span>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 max-w-3xl\">\n      <!-- Free Plan -->\n      <label class=\"relative flex flex-col justify-between cursor-pointer rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-xs hover:border-zinc-300 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:hover:border-zinc-700 transition-all has-[:checked]:border-zinc-900 has-[:checked]:ring-2 has-[:checked]:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:has-[:checked]:border-zinc-100 dark:has-[:checked]:ring-zinc-100/10\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\">\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">Starter</span>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 mt-0.5\">For solo developers</p>\n          </div>\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"pricing-plan\" class=\"peer sr-only\" />\n          <span class=\"flex size-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-zinc-300 bg-white dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 peer-checked:border-zinc-900 dark:peer-checked:border-zinc-100\">\n            <span class=\"size-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 dark:bg-zinc-100 scale-0 peer-checked:scale-100 transition-transform\"></span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-800\">\n          <span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">zsh</span>\n          <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400\">/month</span>\n        </div>\n      </label>\n\n      <!-- Pro Plan -->\n      <label class=\"relative flex flex-col justify-between cursor-pointer rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-xs hover:border-zinc-300 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:hover:border-zinc-700 transition-all has-[:checked]:border-zinc-900 has-[:checked]:ring-2 has-[:checked]:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:has-[:checked]:border-zinc-100 dark:has-[:checked]:ring-zinc-100/10\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n              <span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">Pro</span>\n              <span class=\"rounded bg-zinc-900 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-white dark:bg-zinc-100 dark:text-zinc-900\">Popular</span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 mt-0.5\">For growing teams</p>\n          </div>\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"pricing-plan\" class=\"peer sr-only\" checked />\n          <span class=\"flex size-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-zinc-300 bg-white dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 peer-checked:border-zinc-900 dark:peer-checked:border-zinc-100\">\n            <span class=\"size-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 dark:bg-zinc-100 scale-0 peer-checked:scale-100 transition-transform\"></span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-800\">\n          <span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\"></span>\n          <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400\">/month</span>\n        </div>\n      </label>\n\n      <!-- Enterprise Plan -->\n      <label class=\"relative flex flex-col justify-between cursor-pointer rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-xs hover:border-zinc-300 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:hover:border-zinc-700 transition-all has-[:checked]:border-zinc-900 has-[:checked]:ring-2 has-[:checked]:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:has-[:checked]:border-zinc-100 dark:has-[:checked]:ring-zinc-100/10\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\">\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">Enterprise</span>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 mt-0.5\">Dedicated clusters & SLA</p>\n          </div>\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"pricing-plan\" class=\"peer sr-only\" />\n          <span class=\"flex size-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-zinc-300 bg-white dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 peer-checked:border-zinc-900 dark:peer-checked:border-zinc-100\">\n            <span class=\"size-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 dark:bg-zinc-100 scale-0 peer-checked:scale-100 transition-transform\"></span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-800\">\n          <span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\"></span>\n          <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400\">/month</span>\n        </div>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Variant 4: Radio Segmented Control / Switcher Bar -->\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400\">04. Radio Segmented Switcher</span>\n    <div class=\"inline-flex rounded-lg bg-zinc-100 p-1 dark:bg-zinc-800 max-w-fit shadow-inner\">\n      <label class=\"cursor-pointer select-none\">\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"segmented-period\" class=\"peer sr-only\" />\n        <span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 peer-checked:bg-white peer-checked:text-zinc-900 peer-checked:shadow-xs dark:peer-checked:bg-zinc-900 dark:peer-checked:text-zinc-100 transition-all\">\n          Daily\n        </span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"cursor-pointer select-none\">\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"segmented-period\" class=\"peer sr-only\" checked />\n        <span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 peer-checked:bg-white peer-checked:text-zinc-900 peer-checked:shadow-xs dark:peer-checked:bg-zinc-900 dark:peer-checked:text-zinc-100 transition-all\">\n          Weekly\n        </span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"cursor-pointer select-none\">\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"segmented-period\" class=\"peer sr-only\" />\n        <span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 peer-checked:bg-white peer-checked:text-zinc-900 peer-checked:shadow-xs dark:peer-checked:bg-zinc-900 dark:peer-checked:text-zinc-100 transition-all\">\n          Monthly\n        </span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"cursor-pointer select-none\">\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"segmented-period\" class=\"peer sr-only\" />\n        <span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 peer-checked:bg-white peer-checked:text-zinc-900 peer-checked:shadow-xs dark:peer-checked:bg-zinc-900 dark:peer-checked:text-zinc-100 transition-all\">\n          Annual\n        </span>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Variant 5: Payment Method Radio Cards -->\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 max-w-md\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400\">05. Payment Method Radio Tiles</span>\n    <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n      <!-- Credit Card -->\n      <label class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-3.5 shadow-xs hover:border-zinc-300 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 transition-all has-[:checked]:border-zinc-900 dark:has-[:checked]:border-zinc-100\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"payment-method\" class=\"peer sr-only\" checked />\n          <span class=\"flex size-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-zinc-300 bg-white dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 peer-checked:border-zinc-900 dark:peer-checked:border-zinc-100\">\n            <span class=\"size-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 dark:bg-zinc-100 scale-0 peer-checked:scale-100 transition-transform\"></span>\n          </span>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <svg class=\"size-5 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z\" />\n            </svg>\n            <span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">Credit / Debit Card</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400\">•••• 4242</span>\n      </label>\n\n      <!-- Apple Pay -->\n      <label class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-3.5 shadow-xs hover:border-zinc-300 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 transition-all has-[:checked]:border-zinc-900 dark:has-[:checked]:border-zinc-100\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"payment-method\" class=\"peer sr-only\" />\n          <span class=\"flex size-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-zinc-300 bg-white dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 peer-checked:border-zinc-900 dark:peer-checked:border-zinc-100\">\n            <span class=\"size-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 dark:bg-zinc-100 scale-0 peer-checked:scale-100 transition-transform\"></span>\n          </span>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-sm text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\"> Apple Pay</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400\">Instant 1-Click</span>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Variant 6: Radio Rating / NPS Scale (1-10) -->\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between max-w-md\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400\">06. Net Promoter Rating Scale</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400\">1 (Low) - 10 (High)</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 overflow-x-auto pb-1\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"NPS Score\">\n      <label class=\"cursor-pointer select-none\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"nps\" value=\"1\" class=\"peer sr-only\" /><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 peer-checked:border-zinc-900 peer-checked:bg-zinc-900 peer-checked:text-white dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:peer-checked:bg-zinc-100 dark:peer-checked:text-zinc-900 transition-colors\">1</span></label>\n      <label class=\"cursor-pointer select-none\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"nps\" value=\"2\" class=\"peer sr-only\" /><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 peer-checked:border-zinc-900 peer-checked:bg-zinc-900 peer-checked:text-white dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:peer-checked:bg-zinc-100 dark:peer-checked:text-zinc-900 transition-colors\">2</span></label>\n      <label class=\"cursor-pointer select-none\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"nps\" value=\"3\" class=\"peer sr-only\" /><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 peer-checked:border-zinc-900 peer-checked:bg-zinc-900 peer-checked:text-white dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:peer-checked:bg-zinc-100 dark:peer-checked:text-zinc-900 transition-colors\">3</span></label>\n      <label class=\"cursor-pointer select-none\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"nps\" value=\"4\" class=\"peer sr-only\" /><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 peer-checked:border-zinc-900 peer-checked:bg-zinc-900 peer-checked:text-white dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:peer-checked:bg-zinc-100 dark:peer-checked:text-zinc-900 transition-colors\">4</span></label>\n      <label class=\"cursor-pointer select-none\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"nps\" value=\"5\" class=\"peer sr-only\" /><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 peer-checked:border-zinc-900 peer-checked:bg-zinc-900 peer-checked:text-white dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:peer-checked:bg-zinc-100 dark:peer-checked:text-zinc-900 transition-colors\">5</span></label>\n      <label class=\"cursor-pointer select-none\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"nps\" value=\"6\" class=\"peer sr-only\" /><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 peer-checked:border-zinc-900 peer-checked:bg-zinc-900 peer-checked:text-white dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:peer-checked:bg-zinc-100 dark:peer-checked:text-zinc-900 transition-colors\">6</span></label>\n      <label class=\"cursor-pointer select-none\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"nps\" value=\"7\" class=\"peer sr-only\" /><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 peer-checked:border-zinc-900 peer-checked:bg-zinc-900 peer-checked:text-white dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:peer-checked:bg-zinc-100 dark:peer-checked:text-zinc-900 transition-colors\">7</span></label>\n      <label class=\"cursor-pointer select-none\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"nps\" value=\"8\" class=\"peer sr-only\" /><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 peer-checked:border-zinc-900 peer-checked:bg-zinc-900 peer-checked:text-white dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:peer-checked:bg-zinc-100 dark:peer-checked:text-zinc-900 transition-colors\">8</span></label>\n      <label class=\"cursor-pointer select-none\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"nps\" value=\"9\" class=\"peer sr-only\" /><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 peer-checked:border-zinc-900 peer-checked:bg-zinc-900 peer-checked:text-white dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:peer-checked:bg-zinc-100 dark:peer-checked:text-zinc-900 transition-colors\">9</span></label>\n      <label class=\"cursor-pointer select-none\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"nps\" value=\"10\" class=\"peer sr-only\" checked /><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 peer-checked:border-zinc-900 peer-checked:bg-zinc-900 peer-checked:text-white dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:peer-checked:bg-zinc-100 dark:peer-checked:text-zinc-900 transition-colors\">10</span></label>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Variant 7: Radio Chip / Size Selector -->\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400\">07. Size Selector Radio Chips</span>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <label class=\"cursor-pointer select-none\">\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"size-chip\" value=\"xs\" class=\"peer sr-only\" />\n        <span class=\"inline-flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 peer-checked:border-zinc-900 peer-checked:bg-zinc-900 peer-checked:text-white dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:peer-checked:bg-zinc-100 dark:peer-checked:text-zinc-900 transition-colors\">\n          XS\n        </span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"cursor-pointer select-none\">\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"size-chip\" value=\"s\" class=\"peer sr-only\" />\n        <span class=\"inline-flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 peer-checked:border-zinc-900 peer-checked:bg-zinc-900 peer-checked:text-white dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:peer-checked:bg-zinc-100 dark:peer-checked:text-zinc-900 transition-colors\">\n          S\n        </span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"cursor-pointer select-none\">\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"size-chip\" value=\"m\" class=\"peer sr-only\" checked />\n        <span class=\"inline-flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 peer-checked:border-zinc-900 peer-checked:bg-zinc-900 peer-checked:text-white dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:peer-checked:bg-zinc-100 dark:peer-checked:text-zinc-900 transition-colors\">\n          M\n        </span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"cursor-pointer select-none\">\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"size-chip\" value=\"l\" class=\"peer sr-only\" />\n        <span class=\"inline-flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 peer-checked:border-zinc-900 peer-checked:bg-zinc-900 peer-checked:text-white dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:peer-checked:bg-zinc-100 dark:peer-checked:text-zinc-900 transition-colors\">\n          L\n        </span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"cursor-pointer select-none\">\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"size-chip\" value=\"xl\" class=\"peer sr-only\" />\n        <span class=\"inline-flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 peer-checked:border-zinc-900 peer-checked:bg-zinc-900 peer-checked:text-white dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:peer-checked:bg-zinc-100 dark:peer-checked:text-zinc-900 transition-colors\">\n          XL\n        </span>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n",
